  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "dd6c1ec2-b681-497a-81f9-4b66e8ffaea2",
      "name": "Sticky Note – Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -2688,
        -96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 704,
        "height": 628,
        "content": "## 🎓 Student Lead CRM — AI-Powered Intake & Routing\n\n### How it works\nEvery 15 minutes, this workflow scans a Google Sheet for new student enquiries, scores each lead using GPT-4o-mini, and routes it to the right counsellor — all before a human even opens their inbox. The moment a lead arrives, the student gets a personalised WhatsApp reply, and the assigned counsellor is notified via both Telegram and email with the AI score and talking points.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. **Google Sheets** — Link your `Student lead crm` spreadsheet using OAuth2. Ensure it has two sheets: `New Leads Input` (intake form) and `Leads CRM` (master tracker).\n2. **OpenAI** — Connect your OpenAI API key under the `AI – Qualify & Score Lead` node. GPT-4o-mini is used to keep costs low.\n3. **Twilio (WhatsApp)** — Add your Twilio Account SID and Auth Token. Update the `From` number to your WhatsApp-enabled Twilio sandbox or verified number.\n4. **Telegram Bot** — Connect your bot token. Replace the three `telegramId` values in `Parse AI + Assign Counsellor` with your actual counsellor group/channel IDs.\n5. **Gmail** — Authenticate with OAuth2. Update counsellor email addresses in the same code node.\n6. **Test run** — Add a row to `New Leads Input` and execute manually to verify the full flow end-to-end."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a305a8e6-86a5-4bc7-8284-2e30343807a4",
      "name": "Sticky Note – Trigger & Intake",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1792,
        624
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 508,
        "height": 440,
        "content": "## ⏱️ Trigger & Intake\nPolls the `New Leads Input` sheet every 15 minutes and filters out blank rows before any processing begins. This prevents downstream errors from empty or partial submissions."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "40b8221f-2437-4716-a634-d5012583dcbc",
      "name": "Sticky Note – Data Normalisation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1248,
        624
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 448,
        "height": 440,
        "content": "## 🧹 Data Normalisation\nStandardises field names from varied form sources into a consistent lead object, and generates a unique `Lead ID` (timestamp-based). Handles missing fields gracefully with safe defaults."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "1d5647c4-c340-4e43-999c-35ca5898e237",
      "name": "Sticky Note – AI Classification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -752,
        624
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 532,
        "height": 440,
        "content": "## 🤖 AI Classification & Counsellor Assignment\nGPT-4o-mini scores each lead from 0–100 and categorises intent (Hot / Warm / Cold). A counsellor is then randomly assigned from the roster. Swap random assignment for round-robin or skill-based logic as needed."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "01186f11-8a0e-4074-be51-2a00cf8bf86d",
      "name": "Sticky Note – CRM Logging",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -176,
        624
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 472,
        "height": 440,
        "content": "## 📋 CRM Logging\nWrites the enriched lead record to `Leads CRM` and marks the source row as `Processed = Yes` to prevent duplicate handling on the next poll cycle."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0e2b66de-b809-4e7d-94c4-90b78625cd94",
      "name": "Sticky Note – Notifications",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        352,
        432
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 676,
        "height": 856,
        "content": "## 📣 Notifications\nFires three parallel actions: a WhatsApp welcome message to the student (via Twilio), a Telegram alert to the counsellor with AI insights, and a formatted email briefing. All three send simultaneously to minimise response time."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "219090b9-b876-46b2-a8f3-7df3f11e4e8a",
