        "content": "## 🔐 Credentials & Security\nUse OAuth2 for Google Sheets and Gmail. Store Twilio and OpenAI keys as n8n credentials — never hardcode them. Replace all sample emails, Telegram IDs, and phone numbers before publishing or sharing this template."
